WEBVTT

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.750
A good team of teenagers with attitudes.

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:09.200
Feet together, bow.

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:11.410
That was great, guys.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.580
Cameron, I'd like you to go through the new cotter for us.

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:17.370
You sure you don't want Josh to do it?

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:18.510
Yeah, I'm sure.

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:22.190
Trusting your instincts and your skills is what martial arts is all about.

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.780
Class, I'll do it with you.

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:27.120
You're in it.

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:27.620
I'm sorry.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:33.500
One, two, three, four.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:46.470
With a little more concentration, you'll be great in the competition this weekend.

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:49.720
Yeah, if you're giving out prizes for geeks.

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:53.680
I don't remember you being an expert in this, Phil Boak.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:57.480
It involves self-discipline, control, knowledge.

00:01:58.130 --> 00:01:59.090
I'll tell you what I know.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:05.170
My protégé Biff is going to CRUSH your wimpy dude in the competition!

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:07.930
Show him, Biff.

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:37.700
Once the Hachisaurus has stopped the Dragon Sword, the Power Rangers won't stand a chance!

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.320
They'll be cr-

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.720
Together? Bye. Alright, peace. See you tomorrow.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:53.030
Yo, camera! Come here. I want to talk to you about something.

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:53.770
Okay.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:57.900
Look, man. Don't let Biff psych you out just because he's bigger than you.

00:02:58.550 --> 00:02:59.550
But what if he cheats?

00:02:59.790 --> 00:02:59.970
A-

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:00.740
We disqualify.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.380
I couldn't have done this without you, Zach.

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:04.380
Yeah, you could.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.610
You just wouldn't have been able to do all the cool dance stuffs in between.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:11.220
Hey, just remember, I'll be in your corner if you need me.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:12.520
Thanks.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:13.980
Let's do it.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:21.330
Welcome to the Angel Grove Junior Martial Arts Competition.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:23.860
First round competitors get ready.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.010
All right, Cameron, that's you, buddy.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.970
Hey, Zach, I'm really not sure about those new movies.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.950
Hey, confidence in your skills. I know you'll make me proud.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:34.940
I will.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:43.400
Hey, guys.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:43.720
Hey.

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:57.560
I read you, Zorna.

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.560
Rita sent a monster to Earth.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.600
Teleport to the command center right away.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.400
Ray, I'll get the other Rangers.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:07.480
Hey, Jason.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.160
Well, you guys are in trouble.

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:12.240
We gotta go.

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:14.980
Man, why now?

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:15.920
Sorry, bro.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:24.850
Cameron, I gotta go.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:26.040
What?

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:27.310
It's an emergency.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:29.240
You can't leave.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:33.210
Everything. I can't do it without you, Zach.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.820
Believe in yourself. You can do it.

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:48.250
What's happening?

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:53.260
Rita has buried a bird-like monster named the Hatchasaurus in the ground near the power plant.

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:54.870
Observe the viewing globe.

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:06.230
He's got a serious case of the uglies.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.890
Don't be fooled by its appearance.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:12.190
It is controlled by an ultra-intelligent internal computer called Cardiotron.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:16.120
Your mission is to get inside the Hatchesaurus and disconnect Cardiotron.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.060
Get inside that thing? Oh, gross.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.180
How can we do that?

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:22.150
Have confidence in your skills.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:23.780
I know you'll find a way.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:25.360
Good luck, Power Rangers.

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:27.520
It's morphin' time.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:00.550
Totally.

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:39.390
Some God.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:19.940
The Power Rangers bloom into a zillion pieces!

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.660
It's just right, my queen!

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.210
Bring the Power Rangers here at once.

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:28.660
The Earth is still endangered by Rita's monster.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:34.740
Sit down, what's wrong?

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.930
The Hatchasaurus has not been defeated.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.240
We totally shredded that thing.

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:42.100
You must still destroy Cardiotron, its computer.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:43.880
Observe the viewing globe.

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:51.850
Possible.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:58.980
We're gonna need the Mega Dragonzord to take this monster down.

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:09.100
gonna get rid of those brats today thanks to my hatchosaurus but won't the dragon sword interfere

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:20.240
no the dragon sword is easy for me to stop dragon sword go hear me

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:36.970
If we don't stop this thing, it's going to destroy the earth.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.660
Remember, there is only one way to defeat the Hatchasaurus.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:47.000
We must disconnect the Cardiotron.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.500
Guys, it's Morphin time.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:54.360
Triceratops!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:56.420
Story!

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:43.280
You've had it, birdbrain! He's too tough!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:44.400
It's our turn!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:05.920
Straight for-

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:54.930
So now

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:04.520
We gotta finish him again!

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:05.080
Right!

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:17.380
Check it out!

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:23.640
Energy Force, working against the Zord!

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:24.120
Ugh!

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:28.130
He's got it locked in a spell!

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:29.880
It looks like we're on our own!

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:43.090
Disconnect that computer!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:55.780
Visitor, how nice!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:58.140
A pity I must destroy you!

00:12:58.480 --> 00:12:59.640
It's over, Cardiotron!

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:08.520
I'm afraid that the only one who's going to be broken is you, my little power brat.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:15.770
But since I have nothing better to do, I'm going to break you into teensy-weensy little pieces.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:18.250
Your silly little flute is no match for Rita's evil power.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:20.410
What a bad dragon's on fire!

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:04.560
You are a worthy opponent, Power Ranger!

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:06.520
A pity I must destroy you!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:08.510
Yeah! Yeah?

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:11.550
We are about to feel the strength of Dragonzord power!

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:12.310
Ayo!

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:14.400
No way!

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:14.980
Yeah!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:36.050
So much Bacardiotron, not for that geek with a beat!

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.170
You made it to the highest martial arts level.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:50.900
I just hope he's not too mad at me for leaving yesterday.

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:51.760
I'll help you.

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:02.440
Cameron, man, hey, you made it.

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:03.760
Yeah.

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.360
I'm sorry I had the bell on you yesterday,

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:09.190
but promise I'll be here for the rest of the competition, okay?

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:10.510
Yeah.

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:11.370
Okay.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:13.610
You'll do great.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:14.210
I know you will.

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:16.100
In your dreams,

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:19.840
Biff will make mincemeat out of that cream puff.

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:22.250
Yeah, mincemeat.

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:24.130
Don't let him psych you, Cal.

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:25.820
You call this a psych?

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:28.650
Show him, Biff.

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:48.800
Stick to the fight plan.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:49.400
You'll do great.

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:05.170
with the new moves I taught him.

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:06.950
Uh...

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:24.760
Never Cameron used a new leg move.

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:02.390
Time. The round is over.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:08.420
Judges call. Winner, Cameron Hayes.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.040
Nice match.

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:18.800
Yeah, you too.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:24.020
Great.

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:24.400
Ready?

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:27.560
Why didn't you use the secret weapon move I showed you?

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:28.640
Wait, you mean this one?

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:35.210
So, did I make you proud to that?

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:37.790
Absolutely. Proud because you believed in yourself.
